<title>POLAND: Polish NBP buys dollars at PLN 3.1555 -dealers.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP buys dollars at PLN 3.1555 -dealers.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland (NBP) bought dollars on the interbank market at 3.1555 zlotys, dealers said.</p>
<p>The intervention, described as &quot;medium&quot;, came at 1145 GMT when the zloty was at 2.47 percent from the dollar/mark parity rate for today -- the centre of the daily 14-percent band.</p>
<p>Earlier the NBP also bought dollars at 3.1549 zlotys and marks at 1.8484.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
